Description: SecuBox release-rings — reprepro-copy promotion actuator
 Op-gated argv builders for promoting packages between apt repo rings
 (draft/internal/published) via reprepro copy, with a hard arm64 guard:
 an evolution carrying deb artifacts with no arm64 build is refused,
 never published amd64-only (arm64 is the only production arch and
 would otherwise be bricked).
